        <h2 class="subhead1">Useful Resources</h2><p>Review the City of Pueblo&apos;s<strong>&nbsp;<a class="Hyperlink" href="/DocumentCenter/View/21956/Fee-Schedule-110218-COR-LUP-FEE" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: rgb(189, 66, 46);">planning and zoning department fee schedule</span></a></strong> to access required payment information concerning accessory structures, lighting reviews, demolitions and/or annexations, subdivision submissions, street name changes, and much more.</p><p><strong>Note:&nbsp;</strong>Fees are subject to periodic change with <a class="Hyperlink" href="/86/City-Council"><strong><span style="color: rgb(189, 66, 46);">City Council</span></strong></a> approval and additional fees may be required to pay for postage, legal noticed, and a court reporter, if applicable.</p>
